    "body": "### Pre-submission Checklist\n\n- [x] I have searched the existing issues and this bug has not been reported yet\n- [x] I have tested this issue on the [demo site](https://demo.usememos.com) or the latest version\n\n### Where did you encounter this bug?\n\nDemo site (demo.usememos.com)\n\n### Memos Version\n\nv0.26.0\n\n### Bug Description\n\nLook the title \"February 2026\" of calendar:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efb417b7-70ce-44d6-bcaa-b36698e720f2)\n\nWhen we change the language, other translation message changed immediately, but the title not changed, just need refresh the webpage.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac210ff7-c6df-4353-8774-70efb11586b9\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\nJust visit the bug video.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Screenshots & Additional Context\n\n_No response_",
